== Trivia ==
* This item's appearance is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Zodiac Killer|Zodiac Killer]], who used the symbol as his signature.
* {{dlc|nr}} This item's icon shares the same icon as {{i|Marked}} but white instead of red. {{C|Isaac}}'s sprite is also the same as Marked but black instead of red.

